diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 8347b4a..83facd7 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,23 @@
 # deploy-demo
 
-Deploys the service to AWS on every push to `main`.
+Deploys the service to AWS on every push to `main` and on every pushed version
+tag matching `v*` (e.g. `v1.2.0`). It can also be started manually via
+`workflow_dispatch`.
+
+## AWS authentication
+
+The workflow authenticates with GitHub OIDC by assuming
+`arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/deploy-widget` in `eu-north-1`. No long-lived
+AWS access keys are used; the `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` and `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`
+repository secrets are no longer needed and can be deleted.
+
+The role's trust policy must allow `token.actions.githubusercontent.com` and
+should restrict the `sub` claim to this repository's `main` branch and `v*`
+tags (for example `repo:<owner>/<repo>:ref:refs/heads/main` and
+`repo:<owner>/<repo>:ref:refs/tags/v*`).
+
+## Notifications
+
+Slack notifications use the `SLACK_WEBHOOK` repository secret.
 
 This repository is public.
